      "title": "SandTie PromptRig \u2014 Direct H3 Conditioning",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Direct H3 Conditioning (1-Node Ref2VA / I2VA / FL2VA)\n- Replaces `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` completely.\n- Any cast & voice `.wav`s picked in **Reference Bible** (`Open SandTie Studio`) auto-load from `input/h3_refs/` even without `LoadImage` nodes!\n- Canvas `LoadImage` wires in `ref_image_1..9` merge cleanly in order.\n- `duration` automatically snaps the AV latent to H3's `17k+5` frame grid (`5 s = 124f`, `10 s = 243f`)."
      ]
    }
